---
title: Covenant glyphs
tags: tools
---
{% from "macros/tool.njk" import toolSection with context %}
{% set filename = page.fileSlug %}
{%- set letters = "a,b,c,d,e,f,g,h,i,j,k,l,m,n,o,p,q,r,s,t,u,v,w,x,y,z".split(",") -%}
{% set intro %}
<p class="px-2">
    Convert Covenant glyphs from the video game <a href="https://www.halowaypoint.com/" title="HaloWaypoint.com - the official site for the Halo universe" class="text-convrtr">Halo</a> to their text alternative, these glyphs were featured during an episode of the Halo 5: Guardians behind the scenes show "<a href="https://www.halopedia.org/File:H5G_The_Sprint_Covenant_Font.png" title="Halopedia - Covenant Font image" class="text-convrtr">The Sprint</a>". The "Create image" button downloads an image version of the glyphs selected and displayed below the text version.
</p>
<p class="px-2">
     There is more information available on the <a href="https://www.halopedia.org/Sangheili_(language)" class="text-convrtr">Sangheili language</a> Halopedia page. 
</p>
{% endset %}
{% call toolSection(intro) %}
<div class="col">
    <div class="card">
        <span class="card-label visually-hidden" data-pagefind-ignore="all">Covenant glyphs</span>
        <div class="card-body text-center" data-pagefind-ignore="all">
            <div class="mb-2">
            {%- for i in range(0, 10) %}
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-convrtr p-0 mb-1 border border-3 border-convrtr rounded-circle cov-glyph" id="cov-{{ i }}" aria-label="Glyph: {{ i }}" data-bs-toggle="tooltip" data-bs-placement="top" title="Glyph: {{ i }}">{{ i }}</button>
            {%- endfor -%}
            {%- for letter in letters %}
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-convrtr p-0 mb-1 border border-3 border-convrtr rounded-circle cov-glyph" id="cov-{{ letter | upper }}" aria-label="Glyph: {{ letter | upper }}" data-bs-toggle="tooltip" data-bs-placement="top" title="Glyph: {{ letter | upper }}">{{ letter | upper }}</button>
            {%- endfor %}
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="card-footer py-3">
            <div class="text-center mb-4 g-0">
                <div class="row row-cols-2 g-sm-0 gx-0 gy-2">
                    <div class="col col-12 col-sm-auto flex-fill">
                        <div class="row row-cols-auto g-1">
                            <div class="input-group w-auto">
                                <button role="button" class="btn btn-md btn-convrtr" id="generateCovenantImage" title="Create an image from Covenant glyphs">Create image</button>
                            </div>
                            <div class="form-check form-switch mx-2">
                                <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" role="switch" id="covImageTransparency" aria-checked="false" aria-labelledby="covImageTransparencyLabel">
                                <label class="form-check-label" id="covImageTransparencyLabel" for="covImageTransparency">Transparent background <span class="visually-hidden">for Covenant image</span></label>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-12 col-sm-auto">
                        <div class="row row-cols-auto g-0">
                            <div class="col d-flex flex-fill justify-content-end">
                                {% include "components/select-copy-dl.njk" %}
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <hr />
            <div id="{{ filename }}Results" class="data-to-copy active convrtr-results h5"></div>
            <div id="{{ filename }}ImageResults" class="covenant convrtr-results"></div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
{% endcall %}
